# NOTE: Manifest.toml, Manifest-v1.11.toml and experiments/Manifest.toml are
# deliberately COMMITTED. This project pins its validation environment per
# Julia version (see README) and FJ9.9 treats the resolved dependency set as
# part of the reproducibility claim, not as a local detail.
#
# NOTE: artifacts/ is deliberately COMMITTED. The FJ9.9c ledger classifies the
# FJ8.4b evaluation, the FJ8.4c decision log and the two search snapshots as
# PERSISTED_SOURCE — recorded evidence that cannot be regenerated, only
# checked. Excluding them would leave every reproducibility claim in docs/
# unverifiable by anyone else.

